{
  "title": "About SODOTO Badge Plugin",
  "story": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60001",
      "text": "The SODOTO Badge plugin renders Verifiable Credentials issued through the See One, Do One, Teach One certification system used by Neighborhood Development Centers in the RCN network."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60002",
      "text": "Each badge displays the certified skill, the three completed gates, the issuing NDC, and the issuance date. Clicking 'Verify Credential' performs cryptographic verification of the issuer's Ed25519 signature using the Web Crypto API \u2014 no network call required."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60003",
      "text": "ITEM FORMAT. Add a sodoto-badge item to any page with the following structure:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60004",
      "text": "{\n  \"type\": \"sodoto-badge\",\n  \"id\": \"a3f82b1c4e914d2a\",\n  \"text\": \"Causal Loop Diagramming\",\n  \"credential\": {\n    \"id\": \"urn:uuid:cld-cv-2026-0001\",\n    \"skill\": \"Causal Loop Diagramming\",\n    \"issuer\": \"Columbia Valley NDC \\u00b7 Whatcom County WA\",\n    \"issuerUrl\": \"https://rcn.wiki/view/columbia-valley-ndc\",\n    \"issuerDid\": \"did:key:z6Mkm3G2FWAHZQsTFUGKawaiXWXYj7dYZ6w5JvwaL4mh273Y\",\n    \"holderDid\": \"did:key:z6Mk...\",\n    \"contractId\": \"sodoto-cld-cv-2026-0001\",\n    \"contractHash\": \"sha256:e3b0c44298fc...\",\n    \"issuedAt\": \"2026-02-26\",\n    \"gates\": {\n      \"SeeOne\": {\n        \"completedAt\": \"2025-12-01\",\n        \"mentor\": \"Rosa M.\"\n      },\n      \"DoOne\": {\n        \"completedAt\": \"2026-01-20\",\n        \"mentor\": \"Rosa M.\"\n      },\n      \"TeachOne\": {\n        \"completedAt\": \"2026-02-26\",\n        \"mentor\": \"Andre L.\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"jwt\": \"eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSJ9...\"\n  }\n}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60005",
      "text": "ISSUER REGISTRY. The plugin maintains an internal registry mapping each NDC's DID to their display name, initials, and brand color. When an NDC provides official artwork, their registry entry is updated and all credentials issued by that DID automatically render with the new icon."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60006",
      "text": "VERIFICATION. The badge verifies credentials without contacting any server. The issuer's public key is encoded directly in their did:key DID string. The Web Crypto API checks the Ed25519 signature over the credential payload. A tampered credential will fail verification."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60007",
      "text": "SOURCE. Plugin source is maintained at https://github.com/rcn-network/wiki-plugin-sodoto-badge. Install with: npm install wiki-plugin-sodoto-badge"
    }
  ],
